I had found my earlier knight game a very enjoyable experience.
She was a chaotic and only level 17 or so in the end, which made things
at least somewhat easy.

This is the story of Roland the Knight. The only notable conduct
is genoless, but Roland brought his silver dragon Saint to the
bar with him, and stayed lawful all the way. Roland was also
level 26 in the end.

As I played knights, I would choose a name, Gaynor or Roland
in turn. Many Rolands and Gaynors perished before _Roland_
got in the game. Had a Gaynor succeeded, he would have
turned into a neutral or chaotic.

Roland and his pony Bill entered the dungeons... here is the
tale of this noble champion.

